{
  "summary": "This experiment tested the scvi_n200 RNA encoder in a singleprofile RNA-only setting, achieving validation accuracy of 0.5203 (F1: 0.4982). The result suggests singleprofile RNA-only models with scvi_n200 outperform the previous singleprofile RNA-only baseline (pca_n2000: 0.4849) but lag behind multiprofile scvi_n200 models (0.6530 accuracy). Uncertainty remains about whether profile setting differences or other factors like data distribution and aggregation methods contribute to the performance gap."
}

